ains its conditional serialization registration.\\n\\nTests were not run, as requested.\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_099b836cd17f77a2016abbb08dfe8087d2b8dc398b338c8297\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 829, \"output\": 988, \"cacheRead\": 84352, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 872, \"totalTokens\": 86169, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0.003316, \"output\": 0.019760000000000003, \"cacheRead\": 0.0337408, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0.0568168}}, \"stopReason\": \"stop\", \"timestamp\": 1790685307173, \"responseId\": \"resp_099b836cd17f77a2016abbb07b961c87d2ba2a734261a09089\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}, \"toolResults\": []}\n\n\n[Showing lines 245-247 of 247 (50.0KB limit). Full output: /tmp/pi-bash-58ff8a31910bed2e.log]"}], "details": {"truncation": {"content": "human-intervention-logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-29T12-34-27-127794Z.log:5463:[assistant] `BasicAuthCacheTest.java` already exercises the reporter-requested serialization metadata through public APIs:\nhuman-intervention-logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-29T12-34-27-127794Z.log:5473:[recv] {\"type\": \"message_end\", \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": \"**Planning test refinements for metadata**\\n\\n**Evaluating minimal test refinements for credentials**\\n\\n**Confirming no test changes needed**\", \"thinkingSignature\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_099b836cd17f77a2016abbb07dc47487d2abdf9f948aa60825\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"content\\\":[],\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABqu7CIFVpvyaG7L_qofL5jdqU1yEcT7CXVXO_z2v938g19khjuWNfCXPz3zbnLrjkRbZ3KWrqlN0venHL2EqqCQ7Cfypjfj_kAk6BZQQGyFrhATLVbpPYsVK0qauZ1B0-OtBCbBThLXqLqDnXFEJHdW34VeWXCMKlVwdJowl3NeLWUizyxz