68db79e\n\nEvidence indicates test generation failed to converge rather than a remaining Native Image failure:\n\n- Metrics record 3 iterations, 0 generated LOC, and identical starting/ending commit `d023fac60394e497485da37c5983a938dff64f5b`.\n- The first generation concluded that the existing `BasicAuthCacheTest` already exercises the requested serialization metadata. The next two proposed the same small assertion refinement, but no test change was retained.\n- `fixTestNativeImageRun` completed successfully, and the dynamic-access report completed successfully with the existing test.\n- Artifact URL population also reported that it could not update the `5.3` index entry because its edit was denied.\n\nInspect:\n\n- `logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-29T12-34-27-127794Z.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-29T12-35-30-714520Z.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-29T12-36-41-820768Z.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/native-image-run-fix/fixTestNativeImageRun-2026-09-29T12-29-32-024644Z.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/dynamic-access-report/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-09-29T12-32-44-713436Z.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5:5.3/populate-artifact-urls/populate_artifact_urls.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n\n1. Reproduce the original JDK 25 Native Image run from the preserved branch and confirm whether the generated `5.3` metadata resolves the failure.\n2. Decide whether the existing `BasicAuthCacheTest` sufficiently covers the reported `UsernamePasswordCredentials` serialization access; otherwise retain and verify the proposed before/after-cache assertion.\n3. Populate the missing `5.3` index URL/description fields, check the resolved `httpcore5`/`httpcore5-h2` metadata versions, and run the coordinate’s metadata and full test checks before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0bfc85775dfe5d05016abbb171296887d2be0dea64dbc2b633\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 886, "output": 1430, "cacheRead": 177792, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 809, "totalTokens": 180108, "cost": {"input": 0.003544, "output": 0.028600000000000004, "cacheRead": 0.07111680000000001, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.10326080000000001}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790685537092, "responseId": "resp_0bfc85775dfe5d05016abbb1615d4887d2ad32cb5c6d756c0a", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
